  "iti94:2.1": "tathā tathā bhikkhave bhikkhu upaparikkheyya yathā yathā upaparikkhato bahiddhā cassa viññāṇaṃ avikkhittaṃ avisaṭaṃ ajjhattaṃ asaṇṭhitaṃ anupādāya ",
  "iti94:2.2": "aparitassato āyatiṃ jātijarāmaraṇadukkhasamudayasambhavo na hotīti. ",
  "iti94:2.3": "sattasaṅgapahīnassa ",
